title: "Episodai: Sovereign Cognitive Graph & Episodic Memory Engine for AI Agents"
abstract: "A hardware-accelerated, sovereign local-first episodic memory substrate and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server utilizing Apple Silicon AMX vector acceleration, SQLite WAL, 4-Way Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF), bi-temporal knowledge graphs, and native Obsidian vault sync."
